body:
@josepharhar I’m with you on Solution 3 being the strongest.

It gives author flexibility. It’s practical, I’ve got two active client projects which could use this right away. It would be way neater than the JS / ARIA / finger crossed mess currently in use. It also looks like the simplest approach to polyfill.

I’d love to see this progress further. Please let me know if I can contribute anything to support this work.
